  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Agriculture Employment Creation in Refugee camps and Host Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will directly benefit young women and men (&#x201C;youth&#x201D;), aged 16 to 35. The project&apos;s overall goal is to ensure that small-scale youth chili and poultry producers access fair? markets that enable meaningful income improvements.    It is worthy to note that given that Practical Action has been assigned to work on market access.</narrative>
